# EPDS — Rule Directory

This file used to be the single-source-of-truth ~1,250-line design-system rule. It has been split into focused files in this same folder. Fetch (or rely on autoglobs for) whichever file matches your task:

| File | Mode | Scope |
|---|---|---|
| `core.mdc` | **always-apply** | Stack, design-token rules, component rules, naming, accessibility, "fetch which rule when" pointers |
| `tokens.mdc` | auto-glob (`src/tokens/**, **/*.vue, **/*.css`) | Figma → CSS mapping, three-layer architecture, brand registry, all token tables |
| `components-conventions.mdc` | auto-glob (`src/components/**`) | SFC layout, BEM, library export pattern, child-SFC prop binding |
| `storybook.mdc` | auto-glob (`**/*.stories.ts, .storybook/**`) | CSF3 format, a11y enforcement, story title hierarchy, preview.ts storySort |
| `icons-and-assets.mdc` | auto-glob (`src/components/**, src/pages/**, src/stories/**`) | SVG loader setup, icon/logo/illustration/photo import patterns |
| `build-and-ci.mdc` | description-only | `npm run build`, GitHub Actions, tsconfig quirks, project structure tree |
| `figma-mcp-workflow.mdc` | description-only | Step-by-step Figma MCP workflow for new components and token extraction |
| `atoms-catalog.mdc` | description-only | Every published atom — buttons, inputs, navigation, divider/tooltip/overlay/badge |
| `molecules-catalog.mdc` | description-only | Cards, tiles, modals, navigation/pagination, SRP filter components, VDP molecules |
| `organisms-catalog.mdc` | description-only | Global header/footer, Sonic nav bar, Sonic Circuit, Package carousel, Brand portfolio, SRP filters panel, **plus** `SrpPage` / `VdpPage` |

**When adding or updating a component**, update the matching catalog file (`atoms-catalog.mdc` / `molecules-catalog.mdc` / `organisms-catalog.mdc`) in the same change so the project knowledge stays current. The catalog files are the source of truth for what's already built.
